Subject: [PATCH 02/18] nockchain: wire Tip5 recursion backend

Teach the recursion challenger and FRI backend to use the Tip5 permutation configuration, including the Goldilocks Tip5 circuit challenger path and Tip5 table/preprocessor registration for D=2 verifier circuits.

